    "text": "I, John Anthony Emmanuel Amarathunga, Minister of Lands, herebydeclare under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of the Land AcquisitionAct, that the lands described below is needed for a public purposeand will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.",
